        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1817">

                <pb facs="1188" n="1072" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg1072"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 871.001F37.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-10-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 11, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Ferdinand, Prince of Roumania, was at two o’clock this afternoon proclaimed King
                    of Roumania with title of Ferdinand first. Date and particulars of funeral of
                    late King not yet fixed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vopicka</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
